s is a fourth security release in the continuation of [1.30.x](https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases/tag/1.30.3), mostly to address some severe PHP vulnerabilities and update our official alternative Docker images (Alpine) (our default Docker images based on Debian were already fixed).\r\n\r\nNote that our rolling-release channel (*edge*) is recommended for faster security patches.\r\n\r\nBug fixes highlights 🐛:\r\n* PHP CVE-2026-109618, CVE-2026-109619 [php#2026-10-21-5](https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-10-21-5)\r\n\r\nThis release has been made by @Alkarex, @Frenzie and newcomer @icco\r\n\r\nFull [changelog](https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/blob/1.30.4/CHANGELOG.md):\r\n\r\n* Security\r\n\t* Docker alternative image (Alpine 3.24) updated with PHP 8.5.12 and Apache 2.4.69 [#9475](https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/issues/9475)\r\n\t* Docker: disable PHP `session.upload_progress.enabled` for additional security [#9476](https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9476)\r\n* I18n\r\n\t* Improve Dutch [#9479](https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9479)\r\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases/tag/1.30.4"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","PS1=$(whoami)@$(hostname):$(pwd)\\$ ","HOME=/root","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","PHP_INI_SCAN_DIR=:/config/php","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true"],"exposed_ports":["443/tcp","80/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/freshrss/builds/1.30.4-ls9.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/freshrss/builds/1.30.4-ls9/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/freshrss/builds/1.30.4-ls9/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.git